      '**Humectants** like glycerin and hyaluronic acid draw water into the skin. **Occlusives** like petrolatum and shea butter seal it in. The best products combine both \u2014 pull water in, then lock it down. Colloidal oatmeal is another soothing, barrier-friendly addition.',
