      'Topical steroids work, but a lot of people want to use them less \u2014 whether because of side-effect worries, topical steroid withdrawal fears, or simply wanting a more sustainable routine. The good news is there are real, evidence-based alternatives and add-ons that reduce how often you reach for the steroid tube. Here is what actually helps, and what is just hype.',
