      'Vitamin C also supports histamine breakdown and pairs well here; a [buffered vitamin C](go:pure-encapsulations-buffered-vitamin-c) is gentle on a sensitive stomach. And quercetin works on the other side of the equation by stabilizing mast cells \u2014 our [quercetin for histamine intolerance](/blog/quercetin-for-histamine-intolerance) guide explains how that complements DAO support.',
